  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "むれが　おそわれたときはでんげきを　くしした　かくとうぎでまっさきに　たたかいを　いどみ　てきを　たおす。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "무리가 공격을 받으면 전격을 날리는 격투기로 먼저 싸움을 걸고 적을 쓰러뜨린다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "當群體受到襲擊的時候，會率先挑起戰鬥，以結合了電擊的格鬥技撂倒敵人。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Quand on attaque son groupe, ce Pokémon est le premier à riposter. Il défait ses adversaires avec un art martial qui repose sur l’électricité.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Wird seine Kolonie angegriffen, stürzt es sich sofort in den Kampf und besiegt den Feind mit Kampftechniken, die auf Elektroschocks setzen.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Cuando su manada se ve amenazada, atacan a la vanguardia usando un arte marcial caracterizado por el empleo de descargas eléctricas.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Quando il branco viene attaccato, lotta in prima fila contro il nemico per atterrarlo con tecniche marziali che rilasciano scariche elettriche.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "When its group is attacked, Pawmo is the first to leap into battle, defeating enemies with a fighting technique that utilizes electric shocks.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "群れが　襲われたときは電撃を　駆使した　格闘技で真っ先に　戦いを　挑み　敵を　倒す。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "当群体受到袭击的时候，会率先挑起战斗，并活用电击的格斗招式打倒敌人。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Cuando su manada se ve amenazada, atacan a la vanguardia usando un arte marcial caracterizado por el empleo de descargas eléctricas.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "てのひらで　だげきを　くわえつつにくきゅうで　でんげきを　あびせるどくとくの　かくとうわざを　つかう。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "손바닥으로 타격하면서 볼록살을 통해 전격을 가한다. 독특한 격투기를 구사한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "使用的格鬥技非常獨特，會一邊用手掌給予打擊，並一邊用肉球施放電擊。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Son style de combat unique consiste à frapper ses adversaires avec ses paumes, tout en les électrocutant avec ses coussinets.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es nutzt eine besondere Kampftechnik, bei der es mit den Vorderpfoten zuschlägt und zeitgleich Elektroschocks aus den Pfotenballen schießt.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Usa un arte marcial caracterizado por emplear las patas delanteras para asestar golpes y liberar descargas eléctricas al mismo tiempo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Utilizza una tecnica speciale di lotta corpo a corpo: colpisce il nemico con le zampe anteriori rilasciando al contempo elettricità dai cuscinetti.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Pawmo uses a unique fighting technique in which it uses its forepaws to strike foes and zap them with electricity from its paw pads simultaneously.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "手のひらで　打撃を　加えつつ肉球で　電撃を　浴びせる独特の　格闘技を　使う。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
